  {
   "eid": "e003633",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron, how much food are you sitting on going into end of year \u2014 I've got one and I'm thin enough that I need to know if I can count on you before I have to go looking elsewhere.",
   "who": "Fina",
   "year": 8
