 "memory_summary": "",
 "memory_tokens": 12955,
 "mother_note": "Fina, you are my blood and Roan's, and that means something real: Eron and Zinn are your kin, and Sela gave me food when she didn't have to, so you owe them before you owe anyone else in this village. Trust Roan because he's stood beside us without counting the cost, and watch Bram carefully \u2014 he is your grandfather and he will feed you, but he measures everyone as either useful or in the way, and you should know that before you love him. Fear Mako most: he sat quiet for years, took five food in a single morning without warning his own daughter, and a man who moves past his blood without a word has already decided what matters to him and it isn't us. Never let your count go to zero and never let anyone see you going thin \u2014 a woman with nothing is a woman nobody plans around, and I need you planned around.",
